     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:20pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">R</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">語言內建</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">iris</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">資料集，請撰寫</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">R</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">程式</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">執行</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">10</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">-</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">fold</span></b><b><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">交互驗證</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(10-fold c</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">ross validation)</span></b><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">實驗</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">來分析近鄰分類器</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(1-Nearest Neighbor Classifier)</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">辨識</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">iris</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">品種類別的正確率</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">。實驗設計如下：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(a)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">  \r\n</span></span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">把</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">iris</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">資料集</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">分割成</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">10</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">等分：案例編號的尾數</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">個位數</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">)</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">為</span><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">k</span></i><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">者構成一份資料子集，其中</span><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">k</span></i><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">為</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">0</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">1</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">2</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">3</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">4</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">5</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">6</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">7</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">8</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">或</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">9</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">。每一份資料子集具有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">15</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">筆案例。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(b)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">  </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">10</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">fold</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">交互驗證：上述</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">10</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">份資料子集的</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">每一</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">份</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">都要作為測試</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">集</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">一次，用餘下的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">9</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">份資料子集</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">共</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">135</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">筆</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">案例</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">)</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">作為訓練</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">集</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">，總計進行交互驗證</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">10</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">次。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(c)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">  \r\n</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">近鄰分類器</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">的距離公式分別採用<b>曼哈坦距離</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(Manhattan distance)</span></b><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、<b>歐幾里德距離</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> (Euclidean distance)</span></b><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">、<b>上確界距離</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">(supremum distance)</span></b><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">來</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">計算</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">10</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">fold</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">交互驗證的</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">正確率</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">10</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">次</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">交互驗證</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">的</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">正確率</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">= ?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">正確率</span><span lang=\"ZH-HK\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:標楷體\">的平均及標準差</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">= ?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">我真的不會  拜託幫我度過我的期中考</span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
